   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n    <li>The graphs show the distance, <span data-math=\"d\">d</span>, traveled by two cars, A and B, over time, <span data-math=\"t\">t</span>. Distance is measured in miles, and time is measured in hours. Which car traveled slower? <br><br> <img alt=\"Lines A and B on coordinate plane.\" src=\"exercises/media/45e4816c99a1e474.svg\"><br></li>\n  </ol>",
